 begin="01:02.460" end="01:04.620"><span begin="01:02.460" end="01:03.750">Especially </span><span begin="01:03.750" end="01:04.170">since </span><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.320">you </span><span begin="01:04.320" end="01:04.620">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.620" end="01:07.920"><span begin="01:04.620" end="01:04.890">that </span><span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.250">this </span><span begin="01:05.250" end="01:05.520">ain't </span><span begin="01:05.520" end="01:06.060">nothin' </span><span begin="01:06.060" end="01:06.390">and </span><span begin="01:06.390" end="01:06.540">I </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:07.050">only </span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:07.380">just </span><span begin="01:07.380" end="01:07.920">begun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.920" end="01:16.440"><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:09.000">You </span><span begin="01:09.000" end="01:09.780">never </span><span begin="01:09.780" end="01:09.870">thought </span><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:10.680">that </span><span begin="01:10.680" end="01:11.430">I </span><span begin="01:11.430" end="01:11.790">would </span><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.720">ever </span><span begin="01:12.720" end="01:13.620">go </span><span begin="01:13.620" end="01:13.860">this </span><span begin="01:13.860" end="01:16.440">far</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.130" end="01:24.870"><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.310">You </span><span begin="01:17.310" end="01:17.970">said </span><span begin="01:17.970" end="01:19.290">potential </span><span begin="01:19.290" end="01:20.340">could </span><span begin="01:20.340" end="01:21.420">never </span><span begin="01:21.420" end="01:22.350">last </span><span begin="01:22.350" end="01:22.620">this </span><span begin="01:22.620" end="01:24.870">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.800" end="01:33.570"><span begin="01:25.800" end="01:26.100">Well </span><span begin="01:26.100" end="01:26.730">baby </span><span begin="01:26